      "觀景 / vista": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1;\" markdown=\"1\">\n\n*(Chinese Vista entry goes here...)*\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; color: #a0a0a0;\" markdown=\"1\">\n\nSprint/Nextel and Pentagram Design have collaborated in the\ndevelopment of industrial and user interface design concepts\nfor a simplified mobile phone concept geared for mainstream\nusers.\nOriginally envisioned as a phone for wireless customers\nuncomfortable with technology, the idea has grown to become\nan opportunity to define a broader platform with strong appeal\nacross multiple customer segments.\nOur efforts have created a proposal for a product line and the\npotential definition of a new sub-brand. The following slides\nsummarize our work to date and the opportunity going forward.\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n---",
